{
  "_comment": [
    "The 'Mensagens de voz' dashboard: voice-note usage and the health of the",
    "transcode and transcription pipeline, from GET /api/admin/metrics",
    "(payload.voiceNotes) via the textfile exporter in this directory",
    "(pqp-api-metrics-exporter.py). Import: POST /api/dashboards/db with body",
    "{\"dashboard\": <this file minus _comment, plus \"id\": null>, \"overwrite\": true}.",
    "Steps are in this directory's README, section 'Voice notes'.",
    "",
    "The datasource is the Grafana Cloud Prometheus built-in, uid",
    "grafanacloud-prom, written in directly (the other dashboards here use a",
    "placeholder; this stack has only the one, so there is nothing to remap).",
    "",
    "Every panel needs the exporter on the SFU box to be the version that knows",
    "voiceNotes, and the API to be past PR #984. Until then they read 'No data',",
    "which is the honest state. Most series are rolling 24h or 7d WINDOWS read",
    "from Postgres, so they are gauges that go up and down: do not wrap them in",
    "rate() or increase(). The one counter is pqp_api_voice_notes_refusal_total.",
    "Not provisioned from the repo: the UI is the source of truth once imported."
  ],
  "title": "pqp Mensagens de voz",
  "uid": "pqp-voice-notes",
  "tags": [
    "pqp",
    "voice-notes"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "5m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Usage",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
