      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (pqp_api_voice_notes_jobs_24h{outcome=\"ok\"}) / sum by (kind) (pqp_api_voice_notes_jobs_24h{outcome=~\"ok|failed\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "ok / (ok + failed) over the trailing 24h, skipped left out. Meaningless at tiny volume: one failure in three jobs reads 67%. Division by zero gives no data, so a kind with no settled jobs shows nothing instead of 0%. The alert needs at least 5 settled jobs."
    },
